4. Piper TTS voice models (downloaded at runtime, NOT bundled in the APK)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Per-language ONNX models fetched on demand from Hugging Face mirrors
(user `csukuangfj/vits-piper-*`; originals from the Piper TTS project):
  Copyright: Piper TTS (c) Michael Hansen — MIT License (code);
  voice datasets under CC0 / Open Audio License (per voice).
Covered voices: en_US-amy, en_GB-alan, de_DE-kerstin, es_ES-davefx,
zh_CN-huayan, ru_RU-denis, hi_IN-rohan.
Because they are downloaded to the device at first use (with SHA-256
verification), they are not redistributed by this repository. Downloading
them is subject to Hugging Face Terms plus the per-voice dataset licenses.

